    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/191d9e855786de17534e3bc97440c294.poster.avif?t=1755498640\" width=620 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/191d9e855786de17534e3bc97440c294.webm?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/191d9e855786de17534e3bc97440c294.mp4?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNDISCLOSED </strong>is a <strong>1-4 player co-op horror</strong> game where you play as an <strong>FBI agent</strong> investigating <strong>paranormal events</strong> in the <strong>1950s USA</strong>. Interact with witnesses, uncover hidden truths, and prepare to face unexplained threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/4e59c62226c343aef047d4c5b364ff19.poster.avif?t=1755498640\" width=620 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/4e59c62226c343aef047d4c5b364ff19.webm?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/4e59c62226c343aef047d4c5b364ff19.mp4?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRIEFING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reports of strange occurrences are flooding in from <i>every corner of the country</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your mission, agents, is simple:</i> investigate, gather information, and neutralize any threats. Keep everything under wraps\u2014especially when dealing with witnesses. No information will leave this operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The</strong> <strong>safety of our nation is in your hands</strong>. Stay sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/aaca0ad3dcdcaf024a4ddc6be2e7e12d.poster.avif?t=1755498640\" width=620 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/aaca0ad3dcdcaf024a4ddc6be2e7e12d.webm?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/aaca0ad3dcdcaf024a4ddc6be2e7e12d.mp4?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE INVESTIGATION EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Immersion in the Agent's Role:</strong> The minimalist interface keeps you focused on the investigationand puts you in the shoes of an FBI agent fully immersed in the case.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witnesses:</strong> Use a variety of methods to extract information from witnesses or suspects, including interrogation and threats. Some situations can\u2019t be resolved peacefully\u2014be prepared for unpredictable reactions. And what if they're not human anymore?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On-Site Investigation:</strong> Collect evidence, conduct searches, and break into homes to gather key information. Every action you take will either help you solve the case or simply survive...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/90ab7a358f5f903136bea0dee0a53349.poster.avif?t=1755498640\" width=620 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/90ab7a358f5f903136bea0dee0a53349.webm?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/90ab7a358f5f903136bea0dee0a53349.mp4?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SECRET FILES: PARANORMAL THREATS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intriguing Cases:</strong> Each mission is a stand-alone, unique story inspired by iconic paranormal plots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique</strong>\u00a0<strong>Mechanics:</strong> Each threat is a unique challenge with mechanics that force you to adapt your tactics and approach to solving the problem.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/a36f81eaf4132f552f10a3060d9afbf0.poster.avif?t=1755498640\" width=620 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/a36f81eaf4132f552f10a3060d9afbf0.webm?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/a36f81eaf4132f552f10a3060d9afbf0.mp4?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REPLAYABILITY FACTORS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Investigations:</strong> Loot, building conditions, witnesses, and evidence are randomly\u00a0generated for each mission, ensuring\u00a0that  no two cases feel the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Boss Encounters:</strong> Boss encounter strategies include unpredictable elements, that require players to stay on their toes and adapt in real time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/4906682cda5c441109c173a5af865e99.poster.avif?t=1755498640\" width=620 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/4906682cda5c441109c173a5af865e99.webm?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/4906682cda5c441109c173a5af865e99.mp4?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOPERATIVE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for Cooperative Play:</strong> The game\u2019s mechanics are built to encourage teamwork, with players taking on complementary roles to achieve common goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Voice Chat:</strong> The in-game voice system takes into account obstacles and distance, providing  realistic and engaging communication during missions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/263a89db9d02dc3b69718a84fd7fcfff.poster.avif?t=1755498640\" width=620 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/263a89db9d02dc3b69718a84fd7fcfff.webm?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391000/extras/263a89db9d02dc3b69718a84fd7fcfff.mp4?t=1755498640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
